## 🏗️ OVERVIEW & ARCHITECTURE

### The Two-Layer System

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│         RAW CAMPAIGN DOCUMENTS                   │
│  (50+ pages, messy formatting, irrelevant data) │
└─────────────────┬───────────────────────────────┘
                  │
                  ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│         LAYER 1: OLLAMA (MACHETE)                │
│  • Free, local processing on RTX 2060           │
│  • Runs overnight, batch processing             │
│  • Chunks documents by topic/session            │
│  • Removes formatting/metadata junk             │
│  • Filters irrelevant content                   │
│  • Output: Clean, categorized chunks            │
└─────────────────┬───────────────────────────────┘
                  │
                  ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│    LAYER 2: GEMINI API (SCALPEL)                │
│  • Paid per-token, cloud-based                  │
│  • Fast, precise analysis                       │
│  • Entity extraction with confidence scores     │
│  • Relationship mapping                         │
│  • Contradiction detection                      │
│  • Output: Structured LMS entities              │
└─────────────────┬───────────────────────────────┘
                  │
                  ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│         LMS DATABASE (SQLite)                    │
│  • Entities, relationships, contradictions      │
│  • Full audit trail                             │
│  • User-facing UI                               │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

### Why This Architecture?

**Cost Efficiency:**
- Ollama handles 80% of grunt work (free)
- Gemini only processes clean, relevant data (cheaper)
- Reduces token usage by 50-70%

**Quality:**
- Chunking prevents Gemini from being overwhelmed
- Focused analysis on relevant content
- Better entity extraction accuracy

**Speed:**
- Ollama runs overnight (you don't care about 15min/document)
- Gemini processes chunks in seconds
- Total pipeline: Hours instead of days

